@host = http://localhost:5080

### Governorates (Arabic by default)
GET {{host}}/api/iraq-divisions/governorates

### Governorates in Kurdish via Accept-Language
GET {{host}}/api/iraq-divisions/governorates
Accept-Language: ku

### One division in English
GET {{host}}/api/iraq-divisions/IQG02?lang=en

### Children (cascading dropdown)
GET {{host}}/api/iraq-divisions/IQG02/children?lang=en

### Search
GET {{host}}/api/iraq-divisions/search?q=%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A8%D8%B5%D8%B1%D9%87&limit=5

### Search districts only
GET {{host}}/api/iraq-divisions/search?q=hilla&level=District

### Nearest sub-district to a coordinate
GET {{host}}/api/iraq-divisions/nearest?lat=30.5&lng=47.8&level=SubDistrict

### Unknown code returns 404
GET {{host}}/api/iraq-divisions/NOPE

### Create an order (valid sub-district code)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Ali",
  "subDistrictCode": "IQG07Q02N02"
}

### Create an order with a governorate code (rejected, must be a sub-district)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Ali",
  "subDistrictCode": "IQG07"
}
